# Controllers and transport: a bender track, a pressure track and a CC track; a tempo change
# in the middle; two Stop and Play cycles with long notes ringing when Stop lands; and a track
# at velocity 0, which must send nothing (manual p.40).
seed 11
bpm 100
track 0 mch 1
track 0 mcc bend
track 0 step 0 active 1
track 0 step 0 mcc 64
track 0 step 4 active 1
track 0 step 4 mcc 32
track 0 step 8 active 1
track 0 step 8 mcc 96
track 0 step 12 active 1
track 0 step 12 mcc 127
track 1 mch 2
track 1 mcc pressure
track 1 step 0 active 1
track 1 step 0 mcc 100
track 1 step 8 active 1
track 1 step 8 mcc 0
track 2 mch 18
track 2 mcc cc 74
track 2 step 0 active 1
track 2 step 0 mcc 33
track 2 step 0 len 192
track 2 step 0 lenmul 4
track 3 mch 4
track 3 vel 0
track 3 step all active 1
play
render 2 s buffer=128
bpm 140
render 2 s buffer=128
stop
render 1 s buffer=128
play
render 2 s buffer=128
stop
render 1 s buffer=128
expect balance
expect event bend val=8192
expect event pressure val=100
expect event cc cc=74 val=33
expect event on ch=4 absent
